1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:01,559
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,583 --> 00:00:03,299
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,323 --> 00:00:04,883
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:04,907 --> 00:00:06,760
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,784 --> 00:00:08,397
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,403 --> 00:00:10,029
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,049 --> 00:00:13,256
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,281 --> 00:00:15,196
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,973
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:16,997 --> 00:00:18,537
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,561 --> 00:00:20,308
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,323 --> 00:00:21,903
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:21,923 --> 00:00:23,469
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,494 --> 00:00:27,143
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:29,583
=The One=

16
00:00:29,596 --> 00:00:31,203
=Episode 6=

17
00:00:32,473 --> 00:00:34,913
(Mr. Ji, Xincheng Law Firm confirmed.)

18
00:00:34,929 --> 00:00:35,616
(Ji Sinian's Club)

19
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,280
(Su Yan and Duan Cizhou will team up.)

20
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,080
(Ji Sinian, heir to Aocheng's Ji family)
(Good.)

21
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:38,880
Good.

22
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,520
Got it.

23
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:41,960
Also,

24
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,120
any update on the person
I asked you to look into?

25
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:48,320
(Xincheng Law Firm)
The Ji heir's legal counsel contract.

26
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,480
You two need to land it.

27
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,640
(Zhou Muyun, Xincheng senior partner)
It's our firm's top KPI this year.

28
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,160
I don't care about your personal issues.

29
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,000
Remember,

30
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,360
you're partners I trained.

31
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,040
Keep that professional edge.

32
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,520
Don't let emotions get in the way.

33
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,040
Use them to seal the deal.

34
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,520
Mm.

35
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,560
Cheng Lin!

36
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,400
Where are you, Cheng Lin?

37
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:09,840
Cheng Lin!

38
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:10,560
Sun.

39
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,160
What are you doing here?

40
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,560
I'm looking for some night work.

41
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,680
Something I'm good at.

42
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,200
And it's quick money.

43
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,320
What,

44
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,920
Ms. Su dumped you already?

45
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,440
Hey, no worries.

46
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,800
I'll find you another sugar mama.

47
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:27,800
Come on, Sun.

48
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:29,720
Still got that sharp tongue, huh?

49
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,920
I told you. She's not my sugar mama.

50
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,680
And I'm not doing that kind of work.

51
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,720
You could make money off your looks,

52
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:38,800
but you'd rather do things the hard way.

53
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,120
Fine.

54
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,960
How about waiting tables?

55
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,240
It's hard work.

56
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:44,960
Go.

57
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,040
Go get changed.

58
00:01:47,490 --> 00:01:48,076
Okay.

59
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,120
Tch.

60
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,720
What are you thinking about?

61
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,600
Thank you, Mr. Ji.

62
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,000
It's an honor

63
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,200
for our firm to work with you.

64
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,600
Xincheng Law Firm

65
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,760
looks forward to working with you.

66
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,520
Let's raise a glass to Mr. Ji.

67
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:29,720
Waiter.

68
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,680
Pour the wine.

69
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,440
I hear you're partners in love and work.

70
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:37,840
I've always preferred

71
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,800
working with people in stable
relationships.

72
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:41,160
Stable relationships

73
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,160
make for stable work.

74
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,720
So,

75
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,080
when are you two getting married?

76
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:46,600
Soon.

77
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:47,960
Recently,

78
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,440
we've had a few misunderstandings.

79
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,400
I didn't make her feel secure enough.

80
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,120
That's on me.

81
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,000
But I love her.

82
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,000
I've never once thought about

83
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,720
breaking up with her.

84
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,360
I heard you and your wife

85
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,320
were together for years too.

86
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,640
I didn't make her feel

87
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,440
very secure either.

88
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,000
She left me.

89
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,960
Then win her back.

90
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:17,080
I believe

91
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,920
a bond built over so many years,

92
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,320
no one can replace that.

93
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,280
Young man.

94
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,160
I'll take over.

95
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,160
We don't

96
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:38,920
need you here.

97
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,200
Leave.

98
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:49,240
M-Mr. Ji.

99
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,040
Mr. Ji!

100
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,200
Are you okay?

101
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,640
Are you asking for trouble?

102
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,120
You tripped me first.

103
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,840
Don't make excuses!

104
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:56,640
Get your manager over here. Now.

105
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,880
Apologize to Mr. Ji.

106
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:58,640
And pay for the damage.

107
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,040
I hate having things spilled on me.

108
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,400
I'm so sorry,

109
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,080
Mr. Ji.

110
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,880
You little punk!

111
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,560
Mr. Ji.

112
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,360
Good wine shouldn't go to waste.

113
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,560
Don't you agree, Mr. Ji?

114
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,800
Are you covering for him?

115
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:40,080
We can pay for your suit.

116
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:42,400
But this wine is hard to come by.

117
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,760
It's a 1990 Bolanni.

118
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,720
I have two bottles in my collection.

119
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,760
I'd be honored

120
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,160
to give you one, Mr. Ji.

121
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,480
It's my wife's favorite wine.

122
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,040
Pinot Noir.

123
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,120
A grape that grows in secluded corners.

124
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,440
A little rough at first,

125
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,360
but bold and fiery.

126
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,680
A lot of people don't care for it.

127
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:16,120
But I love the way the flavor lingers.

128
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,920
Mr. Ji and my girlfriend will let it go.

129
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,680
Get lost.

130
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:39,480
All right.

131
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,200
That's behind us now.

132
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,720
Let's raise a glass to Mr. Ji.

133
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,320
Mr. Ji.

134
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:52,960
Mr. Ji.

135
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,320
Honesty

136
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,840
is my policy.

137
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,200
I need to make one thing clear today.

138
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,520
Duan and I have a solid,

139
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:02,280
professional working relationship.

140
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,440
That's all.

141
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:08,200
Not every love story ends happily.

142
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,000
For what it's worth,

143
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,840
if you want your wife back,

144
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,600
sincerity

145
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,600
matters more than putting on an act.

146
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,726
(Ge Yao, Professor Ge's daughter)
Watch where you're going!

147
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:30,040
Who's this soaking-wet little puppy?

148
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,360
Red wine, huh?

149
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,160
Don't touch me.

150
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,040
Oh, a feisty one.

151
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,640
I like that.

152
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,760
What's the rush?

153
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,480
I can afford to keep you.

154
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,960
Your boy toy

155
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,920
is really in demand.

156
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:53,120
That's Professor Ge's daughter.

157
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,480
She's known for playing the field.

158
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,160
Are you going to fight her for him?

159
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,200
Stay with me.

160
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,200
I know you hate the Ge family.

161
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:17,480
I'll take you home.

162
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,400
Su Yan?

163
00:07:23,023 --> 00:07:23,803
(Su Yan.)

164
00:07:25,023 --> 00:07:25,903
(Tell me.)

165
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,510
(What would make you feel better?)

166
00:07:28,536 --> 00:07:31,909
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

167
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:35,596
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

168
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:39,253
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

169
00:07:39,276 --> 00:07:43,723
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

170
00:07:57,883 --> 00:08:01,403
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

171
00:08:01,427 --> 00:08:04,760
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

172
00:08:04,784 --> 00:08:08,211
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

173
00:08:08,235 --> 00:08:11,888
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

174
00:08:11,896 --> 00:08:15,629
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

175
00:08:15,653 --> 00:08:19,200
♪I hum this song alone♪

176
00:08:19,236 --> 00:08:22,743
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

177
00:08:22,767 --> 00:08:26,567
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

178
00:08:26,590 --> 00:08:30,063
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

179
00:08:30,089 --> 00:08:33,896
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

180
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:37,393
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

181
00:08:37,417 --> 00:08:41,891
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
